  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{3}{4}$ multiplied by $3.$ This means that we need to make $3$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/2f08da3896c1162fb008db78bc9e86bc966b1d6431285a8a78e60a626f51be08.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/79c39d7b4ce2da3caf61548d55f4f12cc1e6c64b166c7c808d2d9694aa5ea7a9.png)",
